| `LEAD()`        | Following row | All data types | Optional  | **Required** | **Not allowed** |LEAD(expression, offset, default)
| `LAG()`         | Previous row  | All data types | Optional  | **Required** | **Not allowed** | LAG(expression, offset, default)
| `FIRST_VALUE()` | First value   | All data types | Optional  | **Required** | Optional        | FIRST_VALUE(expression)
| `LAST_VALUE()`  | Last value    | All data types | Optional  | **Required** | Should be used  | LAST_VALUE(expression)

                  

